== Walkthrough ==
There is a crate that is observed at the left of the elevator. You will need to pull it onto the platform, and activate the control to raise the elevator.

In the case of you pushing the crate to the right, it will catch on the pivoting platform. You have to place the crate on the left of the platform, and pull the elevator platform to the right. Be sure to activate the control to make sure it isn't pulled back to the left.

The elevator will finally hold the pivot down, allowing you to push the crate under the rope, in which you can climb.
